BT 1 0 0 1 0 51.8 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.2 TL -0.121372 Tw (For each problem, a multivariate polynomial basis was generated with PolynomialFeatures. The degree was searched over) Tj T* 0 Tw (the full range allowed by the assignment: 1 through 10 for var1 and 1 through 20 for var2. For every degree, a 5-fold) Tj T* (shuffled cross-validation split \(random state 42\) was used. Each fold fit ordinary least-squares linear regression on the) Tj T* (polynomial features. The degree with the lowest mean validation MSE was selected and then the corresponding) Tj T* (polynomial model was retrained on all available training samples.) Tj T* ET
